WEBVTT

00:00:28.274 --> 00:00:32.070
More specifically,
a Grammy-nominated hip-hop artist.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.738
(Applause)

00:00:36.616 --> 00:00:42.413
A quote unquote critically acclaimed,
world-renowned B-list celebrity.

00:00:42.455 --> 00:00:44.165
(Laughter)

00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:46.542
But to be honest, more like B minus.

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:49.462
But again, you all can just call me Cordae

00:00:49.504 --> 00:00:52.215
and assume that I'm
almost kind of a big deal

00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:54.717
because I am here doing a TED Talk.

00:00:54.759 --> 00:00:56.094
(Laughter)

00:00:56.135 --> 00:00:59.055
Now I know what you're thinking.

00:00:59.097 --> 00:01:04.185
What does a 24-year-old rapper
possibly have to say during a TED Talk?